hypotheses.statement:
For every pair of integers $m,R\geq 1$, set $$\label{eq:test-ranks}
 d_0=64m4^R,\qquad d_j=4^j d_0\quad(0\leq j\leq R).$$ There are a compact smooth manifold $Y$, Hermitian complex vector bundles $E_j\to Y$ for all $j\geq0$, and continuous bundle maps $X_i^{(j)}:E_j\to E_{j+1}$, for $1\leq i\leq24$ and $j\geq0$, such that $E_0$ is trivial of rank $d_0$, the rank of $E_j$ is $d_j$ for $0\leq j\leq R$, and $$\label{bundle:scaled-identities}
 \sum_{i=1}^{24}(X_i^{(j)})^*X_i^{(j)}=I_{E_j},
 \qquad
 \sum_{i=1}^{24}X_i^{(j)}(X_i^{(j)})^*
 \leq\frac23 I_{E_{j+1}}.$$ Moreover, $$\label{eq:chern-obstruction}
 \begin{gathered}
 \left(\bigoplus_{j=0}^R E_j\right)^{\oplus m}\\
 \text{contains no trivial subbundle of rank }2md_0.
 \end{gathered}$$

